{"question": "鼓楼区内，500 米内有地铁站的医院有几家？", "status": "answered", "answer": "鼓楼区内 500 米范围内有地铁站的医院共有 10 家（含 □ 个未命名要素），包括：江苏省口腔医院（hospital，70.23）、小市社区卫生服务中心（hospital，135）、南京儿童医院（hospital，254）、鼓楼医院（hospital，307）、南京大学医院（hospital，348）、（无名称）（hospital，417）、南京儿童医院（hospital，419）、中大医院北院（hospital，459）、中大医院（hospital，476）、东南大学附属中大医院（hospital，496）。", "result_ref": "R1", "refuse_reason": null, "steps": [{"tool": "run_sql", "args": {"sql": "SELECT p.name, p.subtype, ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) AS dist_m\nFROM pois p\nJOIN districts d ON d.name = '鼓楼区' AND ST_Within(p.geom, d.geom)\nJOIN LATERAL (\n  SELECT ms.geom FROM metro_stations ms\n  ORDER BY ms.geom <-> p.geom LIMIT 1\n) m ON true\nWHERE p.subtype = 'hospital'\n  AND ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) <= 500\nORDER BY dist_m"}, "ref": "R1", "sql": "SELECT p.name, p.subtype, ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) AS dist_m\nFROM pois p\nJOIN districts d ON d.name = '鼓楼区' AND ST_Within(p.geom, d.geom)\nJOIN LATERAL (\n  SELECT ms.geom FROM metro_stations ms\n  ORDER BY ms.geom <-> p.geom LIMIT 1\n) m ON true\nWHERE p.subtype = 'hospital'\n  AND ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) <= 500\nORDER BY dist_m", "rows": 10, "problems": [], "elapsed_ms": 18.1}, {"tool": "final_answer", "args": {"result_ref": "R1", "result_as": "count", "answer": "鼓楼区内 500 米范围内有地铁站的医院共有 {R1.count} 家（含 1 个未命名要素），包括：{R1.rows}。"}, "ref": null, "sql": null, "rows": null, "problems": [], "elapsed_ms": null}], "model_calls": 2, "repairs_used": 0, "prompt_tokens": 7916, "completion_tokens": 296, "latency_s": 2.28, "raw_sqls": [{"sql": "SELECT p.name, p.subtype, ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) AS dist_m\nFROM pois p\nJOIN districts d ON d.name = '鼓楼区' AND ST_Within(p.geom, d.geom)\nJOIN LATERAL (\n  SELECT ms.geom FROM metro_stations ms\n  ORDER BY ms.geom <-> p.geom LIMIT 1\n) m ON true\nWHERE p.subtype = 'hospital'\n  AND ST_Distance(p.geom::geography, m.geom::geography) <= 500\nORDER